{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-08-10 16:15:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., AUG. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 22 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE NOVEMBER 19, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 29, 2021.'}